# Fab OS system-wide default applications (XDG mime-apps spec, consulted after the user's ~/.config/mimeapps.list, which
# Settings > Default Applications writes). Brave Browser is the browser Fab OS ships (docs/decisions/ADR-0016-brave-browser.md);
# the desktop file name comes from the official brave-browser package (usr/share/applications/brave-browser.desktop).
[Default Applications]
x-scheme-handler/http=brave-browser.desktop
x-scheme-handler/https=brave-browser.desktop
text/html=brave-browser.desktop
application/xhtml+xml=brave-browser.desktop
